		<unit label="chapter" identifier="11" level="4">Mineral Mine Safety Act</unit>
		<unit label="article" identifier="2" level="5">Director and Mining Inspectors</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>45.2-1109</section_number>
	<catch_line>Appointment and general qualifications of mine inspectors</catch_line>
	<text>
		<section prefix="A">Each mine inspector shall be appointed by the Director.
		</section>
		<section prefix="B">Each mine inspector shall hold a certificate as a mine inspector issued by the Department and possess appropriate qualifications as determined by the Director.
		</section>
	</text>
	<history>1997, c. 390, §§ 45.1-161.292:10, 45.1-161.292:11; 2012, cc. 803, 835; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387; 2025, cc. 390, 405.</history>
